{"total_count":359,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/commits/9b346861a924a0e9dd7aaece08c4d2a171b679c7","sha":"9b346861a924a0e9dd7aaece08c4d2a171b679c7","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTU0NzM5NTk3OjliMzQ2ODYxYTkyNGEwZTlkZDdhYWVjZTA4YzRkMmExNzFiNjc5Yzc=","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/commit/9b346861a924a0e9dd7aaece08c4d2a171b679c7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/commits/9b346861a924a0e9dd7aaece08c4d2a171b679c7/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/commits/9b346861a924a0e9dd7aaece08c4d2a171b679c7","author":{"date":"2023-06-29T04:35:56.000-07:00","name":"Roy Frostig","email":"frostig@google.com"},"committer":{"date":"2023-06-30T16:42:22.000-07:00","name":"Roy Frostig","email":"frostig@google.com"},"message":"add `impl` option to random key constructors that picks the RNG implementation\n\nThis change primarily adds an optional argument to both old- and\nnew-style random key constructors. The option determines the PRNG\nimplementation for the key by name, overriding any default\nimplementation determined by configuration flags.\n\nAlong the way, looking ahead:\n\n* We can deprecate the (anyway underused) individual explicit key\n  constructors like `jax.random.threefr2x32_key` in favor of this\n  option.\n\n* Some day, instead of only accepting RNG implementations by name\n  (string), we can also accept the output of some custom PRNG\n  implementation API that we expose, maybe via `jax.extend.random`\n  (corresponding roughly to the current `_src.prng.PRNGImpl`).","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/trees/7ccfd7b141351f408587cf953c19e75afe3c320b","sha":"7ccfd7b141351f408587cf953c19e75afe3c320b"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"froystig","id":123903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzkwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/froystig","html_url":"https://githu